WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.620
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:05.880
If you're creating Amazon product listings in bulk,

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:10.000
you can use our AI tool to help streamline the process.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.520
Whether you're uploading product data from your own catalog

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:16.680
spreadsheet or using an Amazon product spreadsheet,

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:19.680
this feature will automatically convert or enhance

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:23.680
your item details into Amazon Ready Draft Listings

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:27.040
that you can then review for accuracy, edit, and approve

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:29.000
before they go live.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.880
Note that this feature only enhances new SKUs

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:35.440
that you are trying to list and not SKUs that already exist

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:37.560
in your Amazon catalog.

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:41.880
To begin creating or enhancing listings using AI capabilities,

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:45.640
hover over Catalog from the main menu in Seller Central.

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:49.600
Click Add Products, then select the spreadsheet tab.

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:53.200
If you already have your own catalog file, upload it here.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:56.680
Ensuring your product data includes essential information,

00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:59.280
such as item names and SKUs.

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:01.720
While these are the basic fields needed for the tool

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:04.600
to work, the more product information provided,

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:08.800
the better and more accurate the AI-powered content will be.

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:10.720
You will also need to check that your file

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:13.720
is in the proper file format and size.

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:16.480
When you're ready to upload, select Upload

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:19.000
or simply drag and drop the file.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.560
When using your own product catalog file,

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:24.520
choose Non-Amazon File as the file type

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:26.240
from the drop-down menu.

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:28.080
Confirm your spreadsheet details,

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:30.920
such as what row the header information is in,

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:33.520
which column contains the product SKUs

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:37.080
and where the data begins, then click Submit.

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:41.360
If you would like to list using an Amazon template,

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:43.840
you can download a product spreadsheet

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:46.680
by clicking Download Blank Template,

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:49.480
selecting Download Product Spreadsheet

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:52.320
and filling in your product details.

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:55.080
After uploading your Amazon product spreadsheet,

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:58.240
if your file is eligible for AI enhancement,

00:01:58.240 --> 00:02:02.160
you'll see an option to try AI-generated content.

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:04.440
You can opt in by turning on this toggle

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:06.640
before submitting your file.

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:09.360
The content generation process will vary

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:11.920
depending on the size of the file.

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:14.520
You can opt to receive email notifications

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:18.080
about the upload status before submitting your products

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:19.760
or you can monitor progress

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:21.960
through the Check Upload Status link.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:26.040
New products will show as saved as drafts,

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:29.160
meaning the listings are ready for your review.

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:31.520
Select Review and Submit to view

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:34.960
and make changes from the online spreadsheet editor.

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:39.880
Carefully review all content enhanced or generated by AI.

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:42.280
Attributes that are missing required information

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:44.280
will be flagged in red.

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:46.600
You can use the Focus on Issues toggle

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:50.320
to view and edit fields that require additional inputs

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:52.920
are missing or have errors.

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:55.200
You are also able to use the editor

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:59.720
to group your variations by clicking Create Variation Family.

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:01.480
If you'd like to save your changes

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:06.160
and return to your listings later, click Save as Draft.

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:07.840
You can revisit your drafts

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:10.160
through the Check Upload Status link

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:13.680
or from the Complete Your Drafts dashboard.

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:15.800
Once you have ensured that your product details

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:17.560
are complete and accurate,

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:19.640
from the online spreadsheet editor,

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:23.840
select Submit to publish your items in the Amazon Store.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:26.000
All listings must be carefully reviewed

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:30.440
and approved by you before they go live in the Amazon Store.

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:35.160
This ensures you maintain full control over what you submit.

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:37.200
With the help of our AI tools,

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:40.960
you can now create high quality listings with less effort.

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:42.560
For more help with listings,

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:45.600
visit the List Your Products page in Seller Central.
